# Project Fire flight II: the dynamic pressure the measured
# pitch and yaw frequencies require
#
# NASA TN D-4183 (Scallion and Lewis, 1967), figure 17, the SOLID
# segments, digitised by digitize_figure.py.
#
# The report matched six windows of its own six-degree-of-freedom
# simulation to the measured rate-gyro traces by varying the
# dynamic pressure at the wind-tunnel value of Cm_alpha. Since the
# oscillation frequency obeys omega^2 = -Cm_alpha q S d / Iy at
# fixed spin and inertia, these values ARE the measured frequency,
# expressed as a dynamic pressure.
#
# time       s, elapsed flight time
# q_required N/m2
# q_tableV   N/m2, the dashed curve of the same figure
